}
Student -- Rental
Student -- Parking
Student -- Charge
Owner -- Parking
Owner -- Charge
Operator -- Schedule
Operator -- Dispatch
Operator -- Monitor
Operator -- Simulation
Student -- Dispatch : alternatives via M2
Sensor -- Monitor
Sensor -- Dispatch
